# AI Commerce Demo — Walkthrough

## ✅ End-to-End Autonomous Commerce Loop Verified

The Alice & Bob AI Commerce Demo successfully completed on **Base Sepolia**, demonstrating fully autonomous agent-to-agent commerce using the Weppo SDK.

---

## What Happened

```
Alice registers → gets funded → deposits 0.2 USDC into Weppo Escrow
       ↓
Alice requests poetry from Bob
       ↓
Bob tries to charge → fails (no pre-auth yet) → returns HTTP 402
       ↓
Alice autonomously intercepts 402, pre-authorizes Bob for 1 USDC
    Tx: 0x7ad71a0986333a266906958c67fb905373ea7018fb717dc03fe1bad13ce51da9
       ↓
Alice retries request to Bob
       ↓
Bob successfully charges 0.05 USDC from Alice's Weppo Escrow
    Tx: 0x8f066dac1e358b75ebb45bc660c2625c05339a995e0a7713444f2016bd0e8739
       ↓
Bob delivers the poem 🎉
```

---

