## Root Causes Fixed

| Bug | Root Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| [preAuthorize](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/packages/sdk/src/client.ts#187-219) set wrong allowance | Used server wallet as `msg.sender` instead of Alice's CDP wallet | [executePreAuth](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/api/src/services/payment.ts#241-265) now sends via Alice's CDP wallet |
| [charge](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/packages/sdk/src/client.ts#220-246) always failed | Used server wallet as `msg.sender` instead of Bob's CDP wallet | [executeCharge](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/api/src/services/payment.ts#266-298) now sends via Bob's CDP wallet |
| Weppo escrow balance = 0 | Deposit step was conditional / silently skipped | Explicit [deposit(0.2)](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/packages/sdk/src/client.ts#180-186) added before every simulation run |

---

## Key Files

| File | Role |
|---|---|
| [payment.ts](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/api/src/services/payment.ts) | [executePreAuth](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/api/src/services/payment.ts#241-265), [executeCharge](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/api/src/services/payment.ts#266-298), [executeDeposit](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/api/src/services/payment.ts#203-240) via CDP wallets |
| [payments.ts](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/api/src/routes/payments.ts) | Routes pass `req.agentId` (caller's ID) to service layer |
| [framework.ts](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/demo/agent-commerce/framework.ts) | 402 interception → autonomous pre-auth → retry logic |
| [index.ts](file:///Users/user/Desktop/research/wepay/demo/agent-commerce/index.ts) | Persistent agents, fallback funding, deposit, simulation |
